WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:04.580
<i>Kenmi has been deceiving you.</i>

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:10.090
<i>If you believe him,
you 'll eventually fellow his lead.</i>

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.760
I've just realized how naive I still am.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:20.310
I have to refocus.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:24.310
Ruri!

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.400
Are you alright?

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.480
I'm sorry. There's been
so much going on.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:31.780
You were placed
in a frightful situation.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.490
A bit.

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.740
But I believed all along
that you'd come to save me.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.250
Well, I guess for now.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.210
Huh?

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:46.580
For now?

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.690
Here's Kenmi Group's
business reports for the past ten years.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.700
This is everything that's been reported?

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:40.410
Correct.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:42.830
It's just typical information.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.540
We have to investigate on our own.

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.670
I can use my connections.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:53.710
It's our top priority to identify
who the enemy is.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.170
Excuse me.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.340
Ruri, let's go, oni!

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:02.680
I had the car come around.

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:07.480
I've completed your request.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.230
This is it.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:11.900
Thank you.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.400
I can't convince you to reconsider?

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.780
At least, let me talk to him first.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:17.740
No.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.450
I've already made up my mind.

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.080
It's still wet.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:34.790
How come it took so long
at the club?

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:39.470
Oh yeah, Ruri and Kagami
were out today.

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.550
Alma?

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.600
Are you in there?

00:03:45.430 --> 00:03:46.600
Ruri?

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:49.850
What? Why are you here,
all of the sudden!

00:03:49.850 --> 00:03:51.520
Hold on a second!

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:55.190
Ah, hold on...

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:10.000
Still a dull room, oni.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.960
What did you want
to talk about?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.420
About the contract.

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.300
Huh?

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:26.300
Till now, I've ignored your wishes
and done as I pleased.

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:29.890
You've been forced into dangerous
situations against your will.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:33.480
From now on, we'll enter into
an agreement and join forces--

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:36.810
You mean, like if I die
you'll pay a certain amount?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:37.980
No, not like that!

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.480
Well then, what's this about?

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.330
I'll keep it, for now.

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.040
If it's just "for now," then
I don't want you to fight.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.620
Then what do you want?

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:04.050
You don't trust me, do you?

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:07.760
I need to cool off.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:22.030
As I thought, a contract
was uncalled for, oni.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:24.820
What other way is there...

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.610
to keep him with us?

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:31.040
If you just hugged him and asked,
any man would fall for you, oni.

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.330
I can't do that.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:37.880
I need him.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:43.760
You really are troublesome, oni.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:46.930
I got it!

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.780
<i>What are you fighting for?</i>

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:07.490
<i>If it's just "for now," then I don't want you to fight.</i>

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:14.950
Do I really need...

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:18.040
... a reason?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.080
Alma!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:22.590
It's Oni-gawara!

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:26.720
I almost died, oni!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:30.760
See, it's all right.

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:33.810
No, no, oni!
I need to be repaired, oni!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.140
Repaired?

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:40.610
I need you two to find me
a mending stone, oni.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.900
Those you'd find around here
won't work, oni!

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:44.070
How about one of these?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:52.530
No, no, oni! It has to have soul, or else
my glass heart will remain in two, oni.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:54.040
You're made out of clay.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.410
No way, why do I have
to do that?

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:03.670
Please help me, oni. I only have
three days left to live, oni.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:09.090
I can't let Ruri go to my birthplace,
Kamakura, by herself, oni!

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.640
Um, I'll go by myself.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:12.510
I'll go.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.060
Kamakura, yeah?

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.140
Alma.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:20.690
So you said a stone with soul.
What is that?

00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:26.480
Well. You know, a boy and girl do this and that
which creates a crystallization of their love, oni.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.150
Oh?

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.320
Was that too highbrow
for you two, oni?

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:38.620
Geez, so to get the stone, you two
need to keep holding hands, oni!

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.590
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:58.850
Yeah.

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.600
What?

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:03.520
Well, just that it's
an unusual style for you.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:08.070
All the maids helped choose it.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.860
Is it, strange?

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:15.070
Um, well, no, it's nice.

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:32.720
Alma!

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:42.810
First time on a train?

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.730
Um, yes. I always go by car.

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:49.280
Um, I'm so sorry.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:51.690
I've gotten you mixed up in this.

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:54.070
No worries!

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:56.240
I'm the one that said
we should go.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:18.100
<i>Geez, so to get the stone, you two need to keep holding hands, oni!</i>

00:09:27.690 --> 00:09:30.780
<i>The train will be arriving at platform No.3 shortly.</i>

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:34.320
<i>Please remain behind the yellow line.</i>

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:35.570
Why?

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:44.120
Why did you decide to come?

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.980
Thank you for taking time to meet me.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.990
Since Harvard...

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:18.280
I thought you'd be a bureaucrat.

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:21.660
I had a more important calling.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:25.410
Huh? You would have been able
to lead a nation.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.830
You're giving me too much credit.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.840
Anyway, that favor I asked about?

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:34.170
Oh, yeah...

00:10:35.090 --> 00:10:36.840
... about that.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:39.930
Don't go near the Kenmi Group.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.010
They will eliminate you.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:46.390
Listen, you must call off
your investigation.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.370
Oh, it's so beautiful.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.040
This, is it the Eno-den? Alma?

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.720
Ruri?

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.550
Oh, no.

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:24.470
Ruri!

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.140
Alma.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.440
Whew, I thought they got you again.

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:33.020
I'm sorry. I was looking around.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:36.030
It's all good. You're OK, for now.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:37.400
Yeah.

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.110
Um...

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.910
I'm OK.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:45.370
I won't wander off again.

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.080
This place?

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:50.920
Yes.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.920
The Buddha is that way.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.210
Originally, it was in this location.

00:11:57.300 --> 00:12:00.170
So, this is Oni-gawara's brother?

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:05.930
Here you are.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.810
Thank you very much!

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:08.810
Um...

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.110
So, that's it?

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:16.400
I think.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:21.610
<i>You guys are late, Ruri.</i>

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:24.280
So... Did you guys kissy kissy while out, oni?

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.240
Of course not!

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:29.450
Don't get so mad.
It's affecting my crack, oni.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:32.460
They gave us a piece.
Will this work?

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:34.830
<i>Did it flash brightly, oni?</i>

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:35.880
No.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:39.130
<i>The stone should react to your souls, oni.</i>

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.840
<i>Are you two holding hands, oni?</i>

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.390
Um...

00:12:45.470 --> 00:12:47.300
What did Oni-gawara say?

00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:51.310
He said we need to hold hands
until the stone shines.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:52.310
What?

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:58.980
For now, let's grab something to eat.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:03.200
I've decided, you?

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:08.910
I'll have the same as you.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.120
For real?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.870
Super-sized Char siu.

00:13:16.170 --> 00:13:17.000
Here you go.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.840
Oh, thanks.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:21.260
Let's eat.

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:32.890
Let's eat...

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:42.030
Um, should I have not come?

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:43.570
Um, no.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:46.490
Well then, why are you
being like this?

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:47.530
What?

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:51.040
For now, if you want
to say something, say it.

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:53.370
I can't read your mind, you know.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.380
Are you mad?

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.420
At what?

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.420
About yesterday's contract.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.550
Well, yeah.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:07.430
Then, why did you come?

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:12.470
So you don't dislike
being with me?

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.350
If I disliked you,
I wouldn't be here.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:16.690
How about fighting
the Dark Stones?

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.650
You have to ask?

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:22.110
"For now," is it?

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:22.940
What do you mean--?

00:14:22.940 --> 00:14:25.280
You say it all the time... "for now."

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:27.360
Alma, you say it all the time!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:32.030
I do?

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.000
You do.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:42.290
Ruri, when I say "for now,"
it's not what you think it means.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:43.170
What?

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:46.340
I don't fight because
I'm forced to or feel obligated.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.590
I feel that I have to help and fight.

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.560
I see.

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:56.230
So that's the way you feel.

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:59.190
I'm so relieved!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:01.980
Oh no!

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:05.440
I'm sorry!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.400
<i>Have I been making her feel bad?</i>

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:09.450
Let's eat!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:11.320
<i>With just those words?</i>

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.120
<i>Because I wasn't straight with her?</i>

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.960
I was about to ruin it again.

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.040
Thanks!

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:22.250
You're welcome.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:25.250
It was delicious. Thank you!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.130
It's the best ramen I've had, ever.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.380
Is she your... ?

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.470
Thank you for coming!

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.980
What does this mean?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.230
You don't need to know!

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:42.560
Please, tell me!

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:45.480
If you don't say it
I won't know either!

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.320
It means, fr-friends.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.570
Friends?

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:52.660
Yeah.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.580
It's not shining.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.500
Let's keep an eye on it
for a while.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:04.080
Since we're here,
how about we go for a walk?

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:06.670
Eh?

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.340
You were that small boy, Alma?

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.720
You've grown so big.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.060
When did you live in Kamakura?

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:19.480
Well, it was before I started school.

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:23.190
Around the time I started to remember,
my father was already gone.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:25.690
But Ruri, you know about this.

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:31.610
Only Kagami has looked
into your dossier.

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:32.780
I see.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:37.410
Excuse me for a second.

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.640
Yeah, still no good.

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:05.690
Please, tell me.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.070
More...

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:10.190
... about you, Alma.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.490
I made friends after the move.

00:17:16.660 --> 00:17:17.820
Hey!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.210
We didn't know each other's name.

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.710
But that didn't bother us.

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:42.680
Every day was full of fun.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:45.100
But...

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:47.310
What's up with you dorks.

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:48.190
Ouch!

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:59.200
I couldn't forgive him.
I used my powers.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.460
Each time we had to move.

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.800
And each time, I kept losing friends.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:19.800
Alma...

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:23.930
Hold your head up high!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:28.650
If you believe in yourself, the bond between you
and those you care about can't be broken.

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:34.530
You know, I haven't changed a bit
from those days.

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:39.910
This is an important place
for you, isn't it, Alma?

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:43.290
I'm sorry to have dragged you
all over the place.

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:45.580
I don't mind at all.

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:49.790
You know, the stone never shined.

00:18:50.290 --> 00:18:51.170
No.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:53.800
Let's head home.

00:18:59.300 --> 00:19:02.850
I met you around that time.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:04.430
Uh, where?

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.680
The high school under construction.

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.480
Sorry, I don't remember.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:13.820
No, don't worry about it.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.280
Wow, there's still people here.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:20.740
Today is special.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:23.370
They had the beach closed
for a long time.

00:19:23.490 --> 00:19:26.540
Because of the series of accidents
that happened over in Yokosuka.

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:32.000
It finally opened.
So everyone hates to leave.

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:39.760
Alma, you saved everyone.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.260
That's an exaggeration.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:44.810
No, it's not.
You saved a lot of people.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:56.780
Alma, why don't you come in?
It feels pretty nice!

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.490
Nah, I'll pass.

00:19:59.490 --> 00:20:00.400
Ouch!

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.570
What happened?

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:03.910
I stepped on a shell or something.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.870
No, you don't have to!

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.500
You're hurt.

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:12.370
But...

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.500
I got a little carried away.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.010
Oh yeah.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.680
I got them as gift, want to join me?

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.600
How pretty!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.270
Uh!

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:34.730
I'll give you mine.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.990
We've switched our sayings.
"For now," I'll take it.

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:44.570
I'll stop saying that.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.750
Not just "for now," I want
to take your soul into me.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:58.630
I can't do anything by myself.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:00.960
But with you...

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:06.390
Yes!

00:21:07.890 --> 00:21:12.100
<i>You've taught me that there are things
you can protect, even after you break them.</i>

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.480
Welcome back, Miss Ruri.

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:17.400
How was the trip?

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.440
Wha... What do you mean?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.650
You know...

00:21:21.650 --> 00:21:23.570
How far did you go?

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:26.910
I-I went to Enoshima.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:28.490
Aw, that's so romantic.

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:31.830
And I'm like this with Alma.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:33.960
Wait, no!

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:39.750
Oh no, the cackling, oni.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:43.630
Oni-gawara! Y-You're fixed!

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:46.010
Because I was repaired, oni.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.680
How about the stone
with a soul?

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:49.010
Wha-What, oni?

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:50.720
You tricked us.

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:53.730
But look, the crystal of love
is right here.

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:57.690
Oh, so passionate!

00:21:57.690 --> 00:22:01.570
Did you enjoy your Kamakura date, oni?

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.400
You tricked us, you jerk!

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:05.950
Oni, oni, oni, oni, oni!

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:11.540
We were unable to find
conclusive evidence at this time.

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:14.660
I'll dig deeper into Kenmi.

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.380
Yes, please do.

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:23.000
Aiba Foundation is snooping around.

00:22:25.090 --> 00:22:26.720
How pitiful.

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:30.390
