by Naito's words.

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:32.060
Is that OK?

00:22:32.060 --> 00:22:33.100
What do you mean?

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:35.890
They're going to find out about it.

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:38.020
Well, when that time comes...
